sequenceDiagram

    Title: Detailed Sequence Diagram of .cluster_marker_genes() in /backend/analysis/tools.py

    participant p1 as cluster_marker_genes()<br>:graph/tools.py/tools.py
    participant p2 as <br>:orchestrator/call_r_function.py/call_r_function.py
    participant p3 as <br>:orchestrator/r_setup.py/r_setup.py

    p1 ->>+ p2: 1: call_r_function( "cluster_marker_genes",<br>seurat_object, features1,<br>logfc_threshold1,<br>only_pos1, return_thresh1 )
    p2 ->>+ p3: 1.1: load_r_script_and_functions()
    p3 -->>- p2: 1.1: Return loaded R functions
    p2 -->>- p1: 1: Return processed R function result

    p1 ->> p1: 2: Extract result_list from returned value
    p1 ->> p1: 3: Update seurat_object with new data from result_list
    p1 ->> p1: 4: Convert summary to Pandas DataFrame
    p1 ->> p1: 5: Create output directory if it doesn't exist
    p1 ->> p1: 6: Save complete summary to CSV

    loop Process Each Unique Cluster in DataFrame
        p1 ->> p1: 7: Filter DataFrame by current cluster
        p1 ->> p1: 8: Identify top 10 genes by avg_log2FC
        p1 ->> p1: 9: Save top 10 genes by avg_log2FC to CSV
        p1 ->> p1: 10: Identify top 10 genes by lowest p_val
        p1 ->> p1: 11: Save top 10 genes by p_val to CSV
    end

    p1 ->> p1: 12: Print success message indicating completion
